+    - Recolor the entire matched grey placeholder to the template's color, leaving templates and background unchanged.
+
+    Key insight:
+    - The visible colored objects are incomplete, so direct shape matching fails; the correct match appears only after mentally mirroring the half-template across the right bbox edge.
+    """
+    g = np.asarray(grid, dtype=int)
